00:03:33.930 --> 00:03:38.774
Uh, he even suggests that the
chaos portion of lives is sort

00:03:38.774 --> 00:03:43.725
of, uh, and the negative is
female and the order and the yes.

00:03:43.725 --> 00:03:44.924
And the positive is male.

00:03:44.924 --> 00:03:50.505
And a lot of these things that I have
a lot of trouble, uh, accepting, um,

00:03:51.255 --> 00:03:56.025
And in fact, as a general rule, I
