00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:27.150
than some more traditional societies.

00:05:27.210 --> 00:05:33.000
But nevertheless, he does make the point
that the world we live in is one where,

00:05:33.780 --> 00:05:35.130
you know, the individual is important.

00:05:35.130 --> 00:05:37.289
In fact, that's, I should
go there right away.

