00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:52.570
systematically want to tear  it down.

00:05:53.870 --> 00:05:54.570
Fair enough.

00:05:55.245 --> 00:06:00.974
Uh, there's definitely a tendency for
intellectuals, people at universities

00:06:01.185 --> 00:06:05.534
